rong><br>Around 100 distinct types of monsters, traps, and terrifying bosses await. Each has its own rhythm, style, and weakness. Learn, adapt \u2014 or perish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will walk through hell \u2014 and become a shadow that makes even the darkness tremble.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/0c7e930909e7fa6c5a4011ffff8fb62b.poster.avif?t=1754868557\" width=1280 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/0c7e930909e7fa6c5a4011ffff8fb62b.webm?t=1754868557\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3237640/extras/0c7e930909e7fa6c5a4011ffff8fb62b.mp4?t=1754868557\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
